      "dc:source": "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-1994.pdf, p.4",
      "values:originalText": "In this Part, \"Principal Act\" means the Australian Security\nIntelligence Organization Act 1979 1.\nObjects of l'art",
      "skos:definition": "In this Part, \"Principal Act\" means the Australian Security\nIntelligence Organization Act 1979 1.\nObjects of l'art",
