      "dc:source": "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-1994.pdf, p.5",
      "values:originalText": "Section 4 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting \"or the Crimes\n(Hostages) Act 1989\" from paragraph (c) of the definition of \"politically\nmotivated violence\" and substituting \", the Crimes (Hostages) Act 1989 or\nDivision 1 of Part 2, or Part 3, of the Crimes (Ships and Fixed Platforms)\nAct 1992\".\nRepeal of section and substitution of new section",
      "skos:definition": "Section 4 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting \"or the Crimes\n(Hostages) Act 1989\" from paragraph (c) of the definition of \"politically\nmotivated violence\" and substituting \", the Crimes (Hostages) Act 1989 or\nDivision 1 of Part 2, or Part 3, of the Crimes (Ships and Fixed Platforms)\nAct 1992\".\nRepeal of section and substitution of new section",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-1994-sec-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9e4e1c1b38174622cb9722654d0c25166c7c3a4f83c5fdc5e25ee105e7dee6e4",
      "skos:note": "Amendment of definition of politically motivated violence"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-1994#sec-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 Section 5",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 5,
      "values:originalText": "Section 4 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting \"or the Crimes\n(Hostages) Act 1989\" from paragraph (c) of the definition of \"politically\nmotivated violence\" and substituting \", the Crimes (Hostages) Act 1989 or\nDivision 1 of Part 2, or Part 3, of the Crimes (Ships and Fixed Platforms)\nAct 1992\".\nRepeal of section and substitution of new section"
    },
