      "dc:source": "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-1994.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Section 20 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting\nsubsection (2A) and substituting the following subsection:\n\"(2A) A person is not to be imprisoned for a failure, under an order\nmade under subsection (1), to pay an amount by way of reparation,\nrestitution or compensation or an amount in respect of costs....\nFailure to comply with condition of discharge or release",
      "skos:definition": "Section 20 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting\nsubsection (2A) and substituting the following subsection:\n\"(2A) A person is not to be imprisoned for a failure, under an order\nmade under subsection (1), to pay an amount by way of reparation,\nrestitution or compensation or an amount in respect of costs....\nFailure to comply with condition of discharge or release",
      "cml:asserts": [
