      "values:originalText": "Section 47B of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (a) \"during the Governor-General's\npleasure\" and substituting \"under Division 6 or 7 of Part 1B or\nsection 20BS\";\n(b) by adding at the end the following subsection:\n\"(2) In this section:\n`Territory' does not include the Australian Capital Territory.\".\nPermitting escape",
      "skos:definition": "Section 47B of the Principal Act is amended:\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (a) \"during the Governor-General's\npleasure\" and substituting \"under Division 6 or 7 of Part 1B or\nsection 20BS\";\n(b) by adding at the end the following subsection:\n\"(2) In this section:\n`Territory' does not include the Australian Capital Territory.\".\nPermitting escape",
