      "dc:source": "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-1994.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "Section 85ZKB of the Principal Act is amended by inserting after\nsubsection (1) the following subsection:\n\"(1A) Subsection (1) does not apply to an apparatus or device designed\nprincipally for the reception of messages transmitted by\nradiocommunications.\".\nExclusions",
      "skos:definition": "Section 85ZKB of the Principal Act is amended by inserting after\nsubsection (1) the following subsection:\n\"(1A) Subsection (1) does not apply to an apparatus or device designed\nprincipally for the reception of messages transmitted by\nradiocommunications.\".\nExclusions",
      "cml:asserts": [
