      "values:originalText": "Section 85ZZH of the Principal Act is amended by omitting\nparagraph (h) and substituting the following paragraph:\n\"(h) the Australian Transaction Reports and Analysis Centre, for the\npurpose of assessing:\n(i) prospective officers or prospective members of the Centre;\nor\n(ii) persons proposed to be engaged as consultants to, or to\nperform services for, the Centre;\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section 85ZZH of the Principal Act is amended by omitting\nparagraph (h) and substituting the following paragraph:\n\"(h) the Australian Transaction Reports and Analysis Centre, for the\npurpose of assessing:\n(i) prospective officers or prospective members of the Centre;\nor\n(ii) persons proposed to be engaged as consultants to, or to\nperform services for, the Centre;\".",
      "cml:asserts": [
