      "dc:source": "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-act-1994.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "Section 23 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from\nparagraph (b) \"section 4\" and substituting \"section 19AB, 19AC or 19AR,\nas the case may be,\".\n\nCrimes and Other Legislation Amendment No. 182, 1994\nRoyal prerogative of mercy",
      "skos:definition": "Section 23 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from\nparagraph (b) \"section 4\" and substituting \"section 19AB, 19AC or 19AR,\nas the case may be,\".\n\nCrimes and Other Legislation Amendment No. 182, 1994\nRoyal prerogative of mercy",
      "cml:asserts": [
